caption: France Under the Covenant
setting-component: france-under-the-covenant

For most of the lunar month, France is one of the strangest places on GATES Earth precisely because it is comparatively normal.

The Covenant provides the following national protections while active:

- SPA is suppressed to approximately 1.

- Mana is suppressed to Low Mana.

- Spontaneous Gates do not open inside protected France.

- Supernatural monsters and similar hostile entities are pushed away from the protected territory by a nation-scale Avoid-like influence.

This makes mundane technology, ordinary military doctrine, conventional infrastructure, and non-supernatural medicine unusually reliable compared with much of GATES Earth. France has a strong incentive to maintain technological and conventional institutions because it deliberately lives in an environment where supernatural power is weakened.
